Canonical website:
  https://github.com/open62541/open62541

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/open62541/open62541/archive/refs/tags/v1.5.10.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack open62541-1.5.10-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./open62541-1.5.10-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/open62541-1.5.10-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/open62541-1.5.10-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libopen62541_1.5-1.5.10-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libopen62541-devel-1.5.10-X.tar.xz

